# breeze-gtk provides the Breeze-Dark/Breeze GTK theme directories that
# _resolve_gtk_theme() uses as a fallback when adw-gtk3 (AUR) is absent.
# Without this package, blueman and other GTK apps render with no theme.
breeze-gtk
# adw-gtk3 provides the preferred dark/light GTK3 theme for non-GNOME apps
# (blueman, file-chooser dialogs, etc.); _resolve_gtk_theme() prefers it over
# Breeze-Dark/Breeze when installed.
# AUR only; install manually: yay -S adw-gtk3
# adw-gtk3

